    {
      "text": "put away his wife, saving for the cause of fornication, Matt. 5:32 (19:9; 3 Ne. 12:32). out of the heart proceed evil thoughts … fornications, Matt. 15:19. abstain from … fornication, Acts 15:20. keep themselves from … fornication, Acts 21:25. I wrote unto you … not to company with fornicators, 1 Cor. 5:9. not inherit the kingdom … neither fornicators, 1 Cor. 6:9. body is not for fornication, but for the Lord, 1 Cor. 6:13. to avoid fornication, let every man have his own wife, 1 Cor. 7:2. Neither let us commit fornication, 1 Cor. 10:8. works of the flesh … fornication, Gal. 5:19. fornication … let it not be once named among you, Eph. 5:3. fornication, uncleanness, inordinate affection, Col. 3:5. will of God … ye should abstain from fornication, 1 Thes. 4:3. giving themselves over to fornication, Jude 1:7. drink of the wine of the wrath of her fornication, Rev. 14:8 (18:3; D&C 35:11; 88:94). kings of the earth have committed fornication, Rev. 17:2. did corrupt the earth with her fornication, Rev. 19:2.",
